{
 "id": "kesh",
 "nodes": {
  "start": {
   "branches": [
    {
     "if": [
      [
       "flag",
       "enrolled"
      ]
     ],
     "goto": "league_gate"
    },
    {
     "if": [
      [
       "flag",
       "kesh_match_done"
      ]
     ],
     "goto": "regular"
    },
    {
     "if": [["flag", "wren_match_done"]],
     "goto": "challenge"
    },
    {
     "goto": "cold_open"
    }
   ]
  },
  "cold_open": {
   "portrait": "annoyed",
   "text": [
    "New. Wren's talking at you, I can see it from here.",
    "Come back when she's done. Then we play."
   ]
  },
  "challenge": {
   "text": [
    "Kesh. Nine by nine, even game, and we'll draw for colours properly.",
    "Rated game. The result becomes part of your record."
   ],
   "goto": "offer"
  },
  "offer": {
   "text": [
    "Are we playing, or talking about playing?"
   ],
   "choices": [
    {
     "text": "Let's play.",
     "actions": [
      [
       "set_flag",
       "kesh_challenge_accepted",
       true
      ]
     ],
     "exit": {
      "type": "start_match",
      "profile": "kesh_first",
      "context": "kesh_first"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "Give me a minute.",
     "goto": "wait"
    }
   ]
  },
  "wait": {
   "portrait": "annoyed",
   "text": [
    "Take two."
   ]
  },
  "regular": {
   "text": [
    "Back. Good."
   ],
   "goto": "after_result"
  },
  "post_match": {
   "branches": [
    {
     "if": [
      [
       "unranked"
      ]
     ],
     "goto": "first_rating"
    },
    {
     "goto": "result"
    }
   ]
  },
  "first_rating": {
   "actions": [
    [
     "set_flag",
     "ranked_by_club",
     true
    ],
    [
     "rank",
     "22k"
    ],
    [
     "set_flag",
     "invited_to_institute",
     true
    ],
    [
     "quest_start",
     "enrolment"
    ],
    [
     "toast",
     "The club has you at 22 kyu."
    ]
   ],
   "text": [
    "That was rated, so you have a rank now: twenty-two kyu. Read the card; it tells you how the record moves.",
    "Hana teaches at the Instituut, two stops north on the tram. Tell her I sent you."
   ],
   "goto": "result"
  },
  "result": {
   "branches": [
    {
     "if": [
      [
       "won_last"
      ],
      [
       "flag_at_least",
       "record_kesh_win",
       2
      ]
     ],
     "goto": "beaten_twice"
    },
    {
     "if": [
      [
       "won_last"
      ]
     ],
     "goto": "beaten"
    },
    {
     "goto": "won"
    }
   ]
  },
  "beaten": {
   "portrait": "annoyed",
   "actions": [
    [
     "set_flag",
     "kesh_lost_once",
     true
    ]
   ],
   "text": [
    "Right. I know where that went wrong for me, and I'm not telling you.",
    "That was a real win. I'm saying it once."
   ],
   "goto": "after_result"
  },
  "beaten_twice": {
   "portrait": "annoyed",
   "text": [
    "Twice. You're not a beginner any more, you're a problem."
   ],
   "goto": "after_result"
  },
  "won": {
   "actions": [
    [
     "set_flag",
     "kesh_won_once",
     true
    ]
   ],
   "text": [
    "That's the game. You saw where it went, so I won't say it twice.",
    "Everyone does that at your strength. I did it for a year."
   ],
   "goto": "after_result"
  },
  "after_result": {
   "branches": [
    {
     "if": [
      [
       "not_flag",
       "lesson_escape_done"
      ]
     ],
     "goto": "offer_escape"
    },
    {
     "if": [
      [
       "not_flag",
       "lesson_connection_done"
      ]
     ],
     "goto": "offer_connection"
    },
    {
     "goto": "rematch_offer"
    }
   ]
  },
  "offer_escape": {
   "text": [
    "Before anything else. I cut you, and you let the pieces die. Ten minutes and you'll never do that again."
   ],
   "choices": [
    {
     "text": "Show me.",
     "exit": {
      "type": "start_lesson",
      "lesson": "escape"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "Not now.",
     "goto": "rematch_offer"
    }
   ]
  },
  "offer_connection": {
   "text": [
    "You can run now. Next, the half that means you don't have to."
   ],
   "choices": [
    {
     "text": "Show me.",
     "exit": {
      "type": "start_lesson",
      "lesson": "connection"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "Not now.",
     "goto": "rematch_offer"
    }
   ]
  },
  "taught_escape": {
   "text": [
    "So it was never dead, just badly placed. Next time I cut you, run. Count afterwards."
   ],
   "goto": "rematch_offer"
  },
  "taught_connection": {
   "text": [
    "Good. Now you know both halves, and I have to find a new way to beat you."
   ],
   "goto": "rematch_offer"
  },
  "rematch_offer": {
   "text": [
    "Another? I've got all afternoon and a long memory."
   ],
   "choices": [
    {
     "text": "Again.",
     "exit": {
      "type": "start_match",
      "profile": "kesh_9x9",
      "context": "kesh_rematch",
      "intro": "Rematch. Same board."
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "Thirteen.",
     "if": [
      [
       "rated_wins_at_least",
       3
      ]
     ],
     "exit": {
      "type": "start_match",
      "profile": "kesh_13x13",
      "context": "kesh_thirteen",
      "intro": "Thirteen lines. Don't be careful, be right."
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "Later.",
     "goto": "later"
    }
   ]
  },
  "later": {
   "text": [
    "Later, then. I'll be here."
   ]
  },
  "league_gate": {
   "branches": [
    {
     "if": [
      [
       "rated_wins_at_least",
       3
      ],
      [
       "not_flag",
       "match_kesh_thirteen_done"
      ]
     ],
     "goto": "thirteen_word"
    },
    {
     "goto": "league_offer"
    }
   ]
  },
  "thirteen_word": {
   "portrait": "annoyed",
   "text": [
    "Tomás keeps a thirteen-line board under the coats at the back. I've lost four on it.",
    "I'm telling you before you find out, so it counts as honesty."
   ],
   "goto": "league_offer"
  },
  "league_offer": {
   "text": [
    "League game? It counts on the board up the hill, and I want to be above you on it."
   ],
   "choices": [
    {
     "text": "It counts. Go on.",
     "exit": {
      "type": "start_match",
      "profile": "kesh_9x9",
      "context": "league_kesh"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "Thirteen.",
     "if": [
      [
       "rated_wins_at_least",
       3
      ]
     ],
     "exit": {
      "type": "start_match",
      "profile": "kesh_13x13",
      "context": "kesh_thirteen",
      "intro": "Thirteen lines. Don't be careful, be right."
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "Later.",
     "goto": "later"
    }
   ]
  }
 }
}
